  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">BLF Accelerate Spend</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme will result in 1.6 million hectares preserved from change in ecosystem integrity and 4.8 million hectares under connectivity of new or existing protected areas with improvement management. It will pilot the first South American binational corridor to ensure the conservation of critical ecosystems, increase the quality and productivity of agricultural value chains, support bio-business initiatives and enhance cross-border market access for indigenous communities</narrative>
  </description>
